        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "h_t=\\tanh(a h_{t-1}+b u_t).\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Gated memory recurrence:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "c_t=f c_{t-1}+i\\tanh(bu_t),\n",
        "\\qquad\n",
        "h_t=o\\tanh(c_t).\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Move the sliders to see how the forget gate $f$ controls memory persistence.\n",
